{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前有開發者發佈測試報告稱，個人版 Gemini AI 在關聯 Google Workspace 後可能會根據日常對話自動檢索 Gmail 郵件或Google雲端硬盤中存儲的文件。而Google在幫助文檔中提到，Gemini 處理的部分關聯應用數據可能會被人工審核，內容包括但不限於郵件和文件的摘要和摘錄，某些情況下還有可能包含完整內容。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585684.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.171131+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:29:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"53089fab49cb144d73bd7769a09fc314fb24d2d6d79a5cd9beb450e479b47bfb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}